---
title: Sequence Payment Transaction and Sync
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Donor
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as Backend API
    participant PAY as Payment Service
    participant SH as Branch Shard
    participant SYNC as Sync Worker
    participant CDB as Central Server

    Donor->>FE: Chon phuong thuc thanh toan
    FE->>API: POST /api/payment-transactions
    API->>PAY: Tao payment transaction pending
    PAY->>SH: insert payment_transactions
    SH-->>PAY: pending created
    PAY-->>API: pending
    API-->>FE: Cho callback / doi soat

    FE->>API: Callback success / failed
    API->>PAY: Cap nhat trang thai payment
    PAY->>SH: update payment_transactions.status
    SH-->>PAY: updated
    PAY->>SYNC: Day du lieu doi soat ve trung tam
    SYNC->>CDB: Update report tong hop / audit
    CDB-->>SYNC: Success
